      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Delta%2C_Louisiana"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "During Reconstruction, Madison Parish briefly made Delta its seat before moving the capital to Tallulah.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        12
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Delta%2C_Louisiana"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The 1862–63 Union project Grant's Canal cut across De Soto Point to bypass Confederate batteries at Vicksburg.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
